&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;Multicultural team with daily exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1496&quot; data-end=&quot;1532&quot;&gt;Portuguese, Spanish, and English&lt;/strong&gt; (our corporate language)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1629&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1629&quot;&gt;Annual learning budget and internal accelerated development paths&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1630&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1632&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;High-ownership environment: we move fast, learn fast, and raise the bar — together&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1719&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;Smart, ambitious teammates — low ego, high impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1771&quot; data-end=&quot;1837&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1773&quot; data-end=&quot;1837&quot;&gt;Flexible vacation and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;hybrid work model&lt;/strong&gt; focused on results&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1839&quot; data-end=&quot;1951&quot;&gt;If you’re ready for growth, ownership, and impact — apply now and help us redefine B2B finance in Latin America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1839&quot; data-end=&quot;1951&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Clara’s Hybrid Policy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;511&quot;&gt;Claridians in a hybrid mode split their time between working from the office, talking to or visiting customers, or working from home. This hits a balance between bringing people together for in-person collaboration and learning from each other, while supporting flexibility about how to do this in a way that makes sense for each individual and team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;513&quot; data-end=&quot;715&quot;&gt;We don&#39;t enforce a minimum number of days for most roles, but you&#39;re expected to spend time at the office organically, and be at the office most days during your ramp-up or when required by your leader.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

baincapitalventures-bloomreach:greenhous.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Bloomreach is building the world’s premier&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;agentic platform for personalization&lt;/strong&gt;.We’re revolutionizing how businesses connect with their customers, building and deploying AI agents to personalize the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;entire&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;customer journey.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re taking&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;autonomous search&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;mainstream, making product discovery more intuitive and conversational for customers, and more profitable for businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We’re making&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;conversational shopping&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a reality, connecting every shopper with tailored guidance and product expertise — available on demand, at every touchpoint in their journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re designing the future of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;autonomous marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, taking the work out of workflows, and reclaiming the creative, strategic, and customer-first work marketers were always meant to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;And we&#39;re building all of that on the intelligence of a single AI engine —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Loomi AI&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— so that personalization isn&#39;t only autonomous…it&#39;s also consistent.From retail to financial services, hospitality to gaming, businesses use Bloomreach to drive higher growth and lasting loyalty. We power personalization for more than 1,400 global brands, including American Eagle, Sonepar, and Pandora.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are currently expanding our Professional Services team, and we’re looking for a new &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do you want to help top e-commerce businesses boost their performance?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Serve clients and get experience globally (offices in Amsterdam, Bratislava, Prague, London, Moscow, New York, Atlanta and Charlotte).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Want to have immediate, tangible results?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tasks and responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a business consultant you will be responsible for delivering value to Bloomreach’s clients through the deployment and use of the Engagement Platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be supporting clients in the implementation phase with business requirements gathering, preparation of the data structure, data migration process and automated programmes deployment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be a key advisor for clients regarding e -commerce, analytics, data management, digital marketing, marketing automation and emailing + mobile technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will responsible for building strong relationships with&amp;nbsp; clients by bringing continuous improvement to their business, maximising utilization of the platform and improving their KPIs/ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In collaboration with Customer Success Manager you will be responsible for developing&amp;nbsp; business strategy and a roadmap with clients as well as aligning with them on relevant business goals and critical metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On top of the overall knowledge, you will become an expert in chosen part of the platform in order to lead and advise clients and internal stakeholders in a given topic of expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will play a pivotal role in clients’ onboarding, platform adoption and product features utilization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be collaborating with various internal teams to build services focused around the product and contribute for internal process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we expect of the candidate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally 2-3 years of experience in a consulting role within a SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of at least one of the Bloomreach Engagement platform features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the following sectors/fields: online analytics, performance marketing, marketing automation, data science, A/B testing, personalisation, campaign optimisation, customer lifetime value, e-mailing automation, reactivation, attribution modelling, prediction, product recommendations,&amp;nbsp; e-commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ecommerce business and business trends, and the ability to understand clients’ business models and adapt consulting approach accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent consulting skills: clear written and verbal communication, presentation skills, confidence in dealing with business users and stakeholders at all levels of seniority, exceptional organizational skills, proactive problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle difficult situations in a proactive, goal-oriented, and highly professional way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively maintain the highest level of expertise by deepening your knowledge of the Bloomreach Engagement platform and solutions through internally and externally available learning opportunities, as well as self-study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or professional fluency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in Italian, French or Spanish&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-HO1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The pay range actually offered will take into account a variety of potential factors considered in compensation, including but not limited to skills, qualifications, geographic location, accomplishments, experience, credentials, internal equity and business needs, and may vary from the range listed above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;676 821 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;725 182 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;More things you&#39;ll like about Bloomreach:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A great deal of freedom and trust. At Bloomreach we don’t clock in and out, and we have neither corporate rules nor long approval processes. This freedom goes hand in hand with responsibility. We are interested in results from day one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We have defined our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bloomreach.com/en/careers?utm_source=Job-Description-Footer&amp;amp;utm_medium=Job-Description&amp;amp;utm_content=Hyperlink-1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;5 values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; and the 10 underlying key behaviors that we strongly believe in. We can only succeed if everyone lives these behaviors day to day. We&#39;ve embedded them in our processes like recruitment, onboarding, feedback, personal development, performance review and internal communication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe in flexible working hours to accommodate your working style.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We work virtual-first with several Bloomreach Hubs available across three continents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We organize company events to experience the global spirit of the company and get excited about what&#39;s ahead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We encourage and support our employees to engage in volunteering activities - every Bloomreacher can take 5 paid days off to volunteer*.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-Bloomreach-EI_IE442167.11,21.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bloomreach Glassdoor page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; elaborates on our stellar 4.6/5 rating. The &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.comparably.com/companies/bloomreach&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Bloomreach Comparably page&lt;/a&gt; Culture score is even higher at 4.9/5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We have a People Development Program - participating in personal development workshops on various topics run by experts from inside the company. We are continuously developing &amp;amp; updating competency maps for select functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our resident communication coach &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/ivo-ve%C4%8De%C5%99a-2a94291/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ivo Večeřa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is available to help navigate work-related communications &amp;amp; decision-making challenges.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our managers are strongly encouraged to participate in the Leader Development Program to develop in the areas we consider essential for any leader. The program includes regular comprehensive feedback, consultations with a coach and follow-up check-ins.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bloomreachers utilize the $1,500 professional education budget on an annual basis to purchase education products (books, courses, certifications, etc.)*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Employee Assistance Program -- with counselors -- is available for non-work-related challenges.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Subscription to Calm - sleep and meditation app.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We organize ‘DisConnect’ days where Bloomreachers globally enjoy one additional day off each quarter, allowing us to unwind together and focus on activities away from the screen with our loved ones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We facilitate sports, yoga, and meditation opportunities for each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Extended parental leave up to 26 calendar weeks for Primary Caregivers.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Restricted Stock Units or Stock Options are granted depending on a team member’s role, seniority, and location.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Everyone gets to participate in the company&#39;s success through the company performance bonus.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We offer an employee referral bonus of up to $3,000 paid out immediately after the new hire starts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We reward &amp;amp; celebrate work anniversaries -- Bloomversaries!*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(*Subject to employment type. Interns are exempt from marked benefits, usually for the first 6 months.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited? Join us and transform the future of commerce experiences!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If this position doesn&#39;t suit you, but you know someone who might be a great fit, share it - we will be very grateful!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited resumes/candidate profiles submitted through our website or to personal email accounts of employees of Bloomreach are considered property of Bloomreach and are not subject to payment of agency fees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Bloomreach is building the world’s premier&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;agentic platform for personalization&lt;/strong&gt;.We’re revolutionizing how businesses connect with their customers, building and deploying AI agents to personalize the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;entire&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;customer journey.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re taking&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;autonomous search&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;mainstream, making product discovery more intuitive and conversational for customers, and more profitable for businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We’re making&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;conversational shopping&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a reality, connecting every shopper with tailored guidance and product expertise — available on demand, at every touchpoint in their journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re designing the future of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;autonomous marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, taking the work out of workflows, and reclaiming the creative, strategic, and customer-first work marketers were always meant to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;And we&#39;re building all of that on the intelligence of a single AI engine —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Loomi AI&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— so that personalization isn&#39;t only autonomous…it&#39;s also consistent.From retail to financial services, hospitality to gaming, businesses use Bloomreach to drive higher growth and lasting loyalty. We power personalization for more than 1,400 global brands, including American Eagle, Sonepar, and Pandora.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Product Manager – Web Personalization&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Bloomreach Engagement&lt;/strong&gt; product team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will own the &lt;strong&gt;Web Personalization&lt;/strong&gt; area of Engagement – everything that powers how our customers personalize experiences on their websites and web apps: &lt;strong&gt;weblayers&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;on‑site personalization blocks&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;web experiments&lt;/strong&gt;, and the orchestration of these experiences alongside email, SMS, and mobile channels. Working in one of our &lt;strong&gt;Central European offices &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;from home on a full-time basis&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll become a core part of the Engagement product team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the &lt;strong&gt;product vision and roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; for Web Personalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with design, engineering, and GTM teams to build capabilities that:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make &lt;strong&gt;web personalization simple and powerful for marketers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate deeply with our &lt;strong&gt;core data &amp;amp; decisioning&lt;/strong&gt; capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Differentiate Bloomreach vs. competitors in &lt;strong&gt;web &amp;amp; app personalization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the transformation of this area into the &lt;strong&gt;era of AI, Agents and LLMs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team / Product Area&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bloomreach Engagement is our &lt;strong&gt;marketing automation&lt;/strong&gt; product, used by digital-first brands to orchestrate cross-channel journeys across &lt;strong&gt;email, SMS, mobile, web, and ads&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Web Personalization&lt;/strong&gt; product area includes (non-exhaustive):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weblayers / onsite experiences&lt;/strong&gt; (banners, pop-ups, forms, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web experiments&lt;/strong&gt; (A/B tests, variations, targeting).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scenario orchestration&lt;/strong&gt; for website experiences (e.g., &lt;em&gt;weblayers in scenarios&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting components: web SDKs, targeting, frequency capping, templates, analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mandate is to make this stack:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More powerful&lt;/strong&gt; (better decisioning, targeting, personalization).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Easier to use&lt;/strong&gt; (for marketers, not just technical users).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Better connected&lt;/strong&gt; (to Engagement data, AI, and other channels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI native&lt;/strong&gt; (transforming existing approaches to new experiences).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tasks and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Product Manager for Web Personalization, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve the &lt;strong&gt;product strategy&lt;/strong&gt; for Web Personalization aligned with Engagement’s overall vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a &lt;strong&gt;clear roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; for your area, balancing:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-impacting improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic differentiators (e.g. AI-driven personalization, agentic orchestration).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical investments (performance, scalability, UX simplification).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate strategy into &lt;strong&gt;clear problem statements, outcomes, and success metrics&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Problem Definition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run &lt;strong&gt;structured discovery&lt;/strong&gt; with customers, prospects, and internal teams (CS, Sales, PS, Support) to deeply understand:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How they run on-site personalization and experiments today.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where Bloomreach falls short vs. alternatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The biggest usability and adoption blockers for web personalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative and quantitative insights to prioritize problems and validate opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work day-to-day with &lt;strong&gt;engineering, design, and data&lt;/strong&gt; to deliver high-quality features:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear &lt;strong&gt;PRDs / specs&lt;/strong&gt; and success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure &lt;strong&gt;usability risk&lt;/strong&gt; is addressed via close collaboration with UX and research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage trade-offs and scope while preserving the customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end delivery&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;From design → implementation → rollout → measurement → iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Channel Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Web Personalization is &lt;strong&gt;deeply integrated&lt;/strong&gt; into:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scenarios (journey builder).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CDP capabilities (segments, events, attributes, predictions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other channels (email, SMS, mobile, ads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other Engagement PMs to provide a &lt;strong&gt;unified omnichannel experience&lt;/strong&gt; for marketers (e.g., single orchestration workspace combining web and messaging).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market &amp;amp; Adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing, Docs, Academy, and CS&lt;/strong&gt; to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape positioning and messaging for Web Personalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create launch materials, internal enablement, and best-practice playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pricing &amp;amp; packaging discussions for web personalization capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor &lt;strong&gt;adoption, usage, and funnel metrics&lt;/strong&gt; for your features and run experiments to improve activation and long-term engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the &lt;strong&gt;single-threaded owner&lt;/strong&gt; for Web Personalization:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate priorities, trade-offs, and timelines to internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent your area in roadmap reviews, QPRs, and field-facing sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure tight collaboration with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt; (for delivery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success &amp;amp; Solutions&lt;/strong&gt; (for feedback and validation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Product Marketing&lt;/strong&gt; (for competitive differentiation and GTM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Expect of the Candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years of hands-on experience working with web personalization, experimentation, customer engagement, or related digital experience tools in a practitioner role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical background in at least one of:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web personalization / experimentation platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing automation / CDP products with strong web capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web experience / CMS / front-end tools (e.g. A/B testing tools, on-site personalization, web SDKs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Bloomreach Engagement is strongly preferred; experience with similar platforms such as Braze, Salesforce Marketing Cloud Personalization, Dynamic Yield, Monetate, or comparable tools is also valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a product manager is a plus, but not a requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile app personalization experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate real customer and implementation needs into clear product, use case, or solution requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-centric problem solver&lt;/strong&gt;: You can turn messy feedback into crisp problem statements. You are comfortable saying “no” and explaining trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product discovery skills&lt;/strong&gt;: Comfortable running interviews, validating hypotheses, and working with UX/research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: Able to discuss architecture and constraints of web SDKs, tag managers, APIs, and front-end rendering with engineers. Can work with tracking concepts (events, attributes, experiments) and understand their implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven decision making&lt;/strong&gt;: Proficient with product analytics and experimentation. Comfortable defining and tracking metrics (adoption, activation, performance, impact).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication &amp;amp; collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Clear written and verbal communication in English. Able to align multiple stakeholders across Product, Engineering, CS, and GTM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution and ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: You can drive complex projects to completion, even with ambiguity and competing priorities. You’re comfortable operating in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise customers and complex implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI-powered personalization or agentic marketing concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Bloomreach Engagement or similar tools (Braze, Salesforce Marketing Cloud Personalization, Dynamic Yield, Monetate, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior product management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The pay range actually offered will take into account a variety of potential factors considered in compensation, including but not limited to skills, qualifications, geographic location, accomplishments, experience, credentials, internal equity and business needs, and may vary from the range listed above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 219 048 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 523 810 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;More things you&#39;ll like about Bloomreach:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
