nea-mejuri:greenhouse:4683769006.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2015, Mejuri has reimagined what fine jewelry can be in a modern world—shifting it from a traditional gift to to a personal choice rooted in self-expression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by third-generation jeweller Noura Sakkijha, the brand was built on a simple idea: fine jewelry shouldn’t require a special occasion, and it should never come with guilt. It’s about celebrating yourself—your style, your life, your everyday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mejuri meets customers where they are—online, in app, and through a growing global retail footprint of 58+ stores worldwide. Mejuri is also deeply committed to doing things the right way, with responsible sourcing, sustainable practices, and philanthropic initiatives that reflect our values and long-term vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Floor Lead&lt;/strong&gt; plays a pivotal role on our store leadership team, driving the success of the store by upholding exceptional customer service standards, fostering team development, and ensuring seamless execution of daily operations. As a key presence on the sales floor, the Floor Lead exemplifies outstanding interpersonal skills and consistently embodies Mejuri’s values. A natural motivator and collaborative team player, they inspire the team with a can-do attitude, creating an engaging and dynamic environment for both staff and customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Retail leaders at Mejuri are engaging, nimble, creative and driven. Join us in redefining luxury—one customer, one team member, and one exceptional experience at a time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead by example and validate the quality of the in-store customer experience by communicating, training, and upholding expectations on the team on Mejuri’s Steps of Selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Maximize results and achievement of Key Performance Indicators (KPIs), by driving own performance as well as the performance and engagement of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Services&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure positive customer experience and promotion of services offerings including piercing, engraving, and other offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPIs:&lt;/strong&gt; OPH, NPS (85%&amp;lt;), SPH, STACK Leader Segment: Conversion and Sales Success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory&lt;/strong&gt;. Participate as needed in the execution of inventory &amp;amp; cycle counts on a monthly basis, ensuring teams have proper technology in place and troubleshooting guidance where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Order Fulfillment&lt;/strong&gt;: Participate as needed the back of house flow to support in-store sales, phone sales or BOPIS, ensuring efficiency with packaging and order delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Storage &amp;amp; Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: Support in maintaining organizational integrity of our BOH up to and including display inventory and sellable inventory, packaging, and all supplies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient in using point-of-sale systems, inventory management software, and other retail technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shrink:&lt;/strong&gt; Support in mitigating internal, external and administrative loss of product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Escalations&lt;/strong&gt;: Participate in Identify and escalate opportunities, gaps, risks and roadblocks with urgency and partner as needed with cross functional teams to resolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merchandising:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merchandising:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in the maintenance of Mejuri’s brand standards of visual presentation, cleanliness and functionality are upheld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fixtures &amp;amp; Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt; Support with validating the integrity of all display forms, graphics, furniture, and decor items to manage costs and propel the brand, notifying appropriate teams when display tools are missing or damaged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visual Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in coaching and informing all store team members on updates or changes to Visual Merchandising standard practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merchandising:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in ensuring that Mejuri brand standards of visual presentation, cleanliness and functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Escalations:&lt;/strong&gt; Flag, identify and action any inefficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;: Participate in the successful integration of new talent to our store teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assessing&lt;/strong&gt;: Validate the regular and accurate assessment of our people against performance review criteria and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engaging&lt;/strong&gt;: Build healthy relationships with our people and establish a positive and engaging work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Relations:&lt;/strong&gt; Adhere to and validate our policies and compliance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high volume retail environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable with the ability to think creatively and quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinking ability - identify potential challenges and develop action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physical requirements: Ability to stand for 8 hours, lift up to 50 lbs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work evenings, weekends &amp;amp; holidays in alignment with the stores availability requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits at Mejuri:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly retail bonus program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular feedback via performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A robust in-house retail learning program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous product discount!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Looking for the perfect next opportunity is a big decision. Mejuri recognizes the importance of pay transparency when it comes to salary ranges as it empowers individuals through the hiring process and supports them in making an informed decision. This role currently has a base pay range of £15-£16 per hour based on a candidate’s experience and qualifications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Mejuri our success is driven by a strong commitment to our Purpose and Values. They&#39;re the foundation of our operations, defining how we show up, solve problems, and accomplish incredible things—together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength comes from each team member&#39;s dedication to embracing and embodying these Values daily. This isn&#39;t merely a duty; it&#39;s a passion that defines us. They guide us in providing extraordinary experiences for our customers and fostering an innovative environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Success, for us, means living our values relentlessly.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our values are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RAISE THE BAR&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;| Stay Curious, Share/Seek Feedback, and Strive for Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CUSTOMER OBSESSED&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;| Get close to the customer and prioritize them in our decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMPOWERED OWNERS |&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Treat the company like your own, take initiative&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FIND A WAY |&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Seek simple, creative solutions, and act fast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DRIVE RESULTS&lt;/strong&gt; | Be clear on your goals and be relentless in achieving them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEAM FIRST&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;| Value team success over personal ego&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodation / Accessibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mejuri does not discriminate in hiring or terms and conditions of employment because of an individual’s race, ancestry, colour, place of origin, religion, gender, gender identity, national origin, citizenship, age, disability, sexual orientation, family status or marital status, or any other protected category recognized by provincial or federal laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you require any accommodation, please inform us and we will work with you to meet your accessibility needs. For any accessibility-related assistance, requests for information in accessible alternative formats or to report any accessibility problems, please share in your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

nvp-banyan-software:greenhouse:514564400.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. We are on a mission to acquire, build, and grow great companies worldwide, helping them modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world. Banyan is Great Place to Work Certified, a five-time Inc. 5000 honoree, and a top 10 company on the Deloitte Technology Fast 500. Founded in 2016 and headquartered in Atlanta, Banyan operates more than 100 portfolio companies across North America, the UK, EU, and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is seeking a highly organized and detail-oriented Corporate Clerk / Paralegal to join Banyan’s Legal team. This role is essential to maintaining the corporate governance infrastructure across Banyan and its growing portfolio of software companies. The successful candidate will own corporate records, entity administration, minute books, M&amp;amp;A transaction support, equity administration, and compliance obligations across multiple global jurisdictions. This is a high-trust, high-autonomy role for someone who runs the function&amp;nbsp; not just supports it&amp;nbsp; and who uses AI to build scalable processes, not just complete tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Toronto&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; (3 days On-Site)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(This posting is to backfill existing vacancy)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Legal Operations &amp;amp; AI-Assisted Workflows&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach every recurring task as a process design opportunity. If you do something more than once, your instinct should be to build a template, checklist, or automated workflow around it — not to repeat it manually. Own the design and continuous improvement of Banyan’s legal operations playbooks, compliance calendars, and tracking systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools — including Claude and ChatGPT — as core daily instruments. Draft documents, build compliance trackers, summarize diligence materials, generate first-pass resolutions, and automate repetitive workflows using AI. Be the person on the team who pushes the boundaries of what AI-assisted legal work looks like in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with legal leadership to identify where manual effort persists and propose technology or workflow solutions. Contribute to the design of Banyan’s legal tech stack as the portfolio continues to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Corporate Records, Entity Management and Credit Agreement Administration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and organize all corporate records, minute books, registers, and governing documents for Banyan and its portfolio companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, circulate, and file board and shareholder resolutions, meeting minutes, written consents, and annual organizational documents. Coordinate board and shareholder meeting logistics for Banyan’s portfolio companies and maintain proper documentation of all governance actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the formation, registration, qualification, and dissolution of legal entities across global jurisdictions. Coordinate tax ID applications, registered agent appointments, and ongoing entity maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and prepare joinder documentation when new entities (including newly acquired portfolio companies) join existing credit facilities, working with external counsel and lenders to ensure all conditions to joinder are satisfied and executed documents are properly filed and tracked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate lender consent requests, amendment and waiver processes, and related administrative correspondence. Prepare summary materials and organize execution packages for lender review and sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Shareholder Administration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer equity records and share register updates in Computershare, including share issuances, transfers, cancellations, and cap table maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage equity plan administration and grant processing in Carta, including coordinating equity grant forms, vesting schedules, and participant communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and organize share certificates, stock powers, and related shareholder documentation for Banyan and its portfolio companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Finance and external advisors on KYC/AML documentation, beneficial ownership filings, and banking compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Cross-Jurisdictional Compliance&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and ensure compliance with corporate filing obligations across global jurisdictions, including annual reports, business licences, and foreign qualification requirements. Track regulatory deadlines and proactively flag upcoming obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and file state/provincial annual reports, amendments, and other statutory filings. Track and respond to correspondence from regulatory authorities, including CRA surveys, IRS notices, and state/provincial information requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for registered agents, accountants, and other service providers on entity-level matters. Coordinate information requests, manage timelines, and ensure deliverables are completed on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;M&amp;amp;A Transaction Support&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with post-acquisition corporate governance integration, including entity restructuring, name changes, officer/director updates, and alignment with Banyan’s governance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and assemble closing document packages and ancillary closing deliverables (secretary’s certificates, FIRPTA certifications, stock powers, IP assignments, officer/director resignations, payment direction letters, and similar documents) in support of transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Supporting Legal Operations&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Support day-to-day commercial contracting needs, including drafting and reviewing straightforward agreements (NDAs, vendor contracts, service agreements, and similar documents), preparing routine legal correspondence, and assisting with notarization and execution logistics.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Manage corporate insurance programs across Banyan and its portfolio companies, including coordinating policy renewals, liaising with brokers, processing certificates of insurance, and ensuring portfolio companies maintain required coverage acquisition.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Maintain an intellectual property database across portfolio companies, coordinating with external counsel on trademark, patent, and other IP registrations, renewals, and filings to ensure no deadlines are missed.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Triage incoming legal requests and correspondence, route matters to the appropriate internal team member or external counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience as a corporate clerk, paralegal, or in a corporate governance/legal support role, ideally within a multi-entity environment (private equity, venture capital, or holding company experience preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of corporate governance practices, minute book management, and entity lifecycle administration across global jurisdictions, with particular depth in North American corporate law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Computershare or Carta (or comparable equity administration platforms) strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine builder’s mindset toward AI — you use Claude and ChatGPT daily, not occasionally, and you think constantly about how to use them to create better processes, not just faster outputs. You seek out new ways to apply AI before being asked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational and project management skills, with the ability to manage multiple deadlines, entities, and advisors simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills for coordinating with internal teams, portfolio company leadership, and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and a zero-error mentality when it comes to filings, resolutions, and governance documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paralegal certificate or diploma preferred; Law Clerk designation (Ontario ILCO or equivalent) is an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed operator who can own the corporate governance function end-to-end with minimal supervision — setting priorities, driving deadlines, managing advisors, and running this workstream as the internal expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected base salary for this position is: [CAD $70,000 - $90,000] excluding annual bonus and equity (when applicable). Salary is based on a number of factors including market conditions, location and may vary depending on job-related skills and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is for an existing vacancy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion &amp;amp; Equal Employment Opportunity at Banyan: Banyan affirms that inequality is detrimental to our Global Teams, associates, our Operating Companies, and the communities we serve. As a collective, our goal is to impact lasting change through our actions. Together, we unite for equality and equity. Banyan is committed to equal employment opportunities regardless of any protected characteristic, including race, color, genetic information, creed, national origin, religion, sex, affectional or sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, lawful alien status, ancestry, age, marital status, or protected veteran status and will not discriminate against anyone on the basis of a disability. We support an inclusive workplace where associates excel based on personal merit, qualifications, experience, ability, and job performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Banyan Software may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to assist in screening and/or assessing applicants during the recruitment process. All hiring decisions are made by our team. Personal information submitted through your application will be collected and used for recruitment purposes in accordance with applicable privacy laws. Contact us at any time with questions about our process or to request accommodation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beware of Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have been made aware of individuals fraudulently posing as members of our Talent Acquisition team and extending fake job offers. These scams may involve requests for personal information or payment for equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself by following these steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify that all communications from our recruiting team come from an &lt;strong&gt;@banyansoftware.com&lt;/strong&gt; email address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remember, employers will &lt;strong&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt; request payment or banking information during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you receive a suspicious message, &lt;strong&gt;do not respond&lt;/strong&gt; — instead, forward it to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@banyansoftware.com&quot;&gt;careers@banyansoftware.com&lt;/a&gt; and/or report it to the platform where you received it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your safety and security are important to us. Thank you for staying vigilant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

nvp-courier-health:greenhouse:5081754007.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Courier Health is on a mission to solve one of the biggest and most meaningful opportunities in healthcare: reinvent how people living with chronic and rare diseases are supported.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the future of patient engagement for life sciences companies. Our software is leveraged by biopharma companies to support patients in their complex journey from diagnosis to initiating and remaining on therapy to achieve optimal health outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the execution of enterprise pharmaceutical client implementations end-to-end. To ensure successful project delivery, you will hold internal and external stakeholders accountable, protect scope with conviction, and project confidence to client teams even when things are hard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a high-performing Client Solutions team with a strong track record and a clear standard of excellence. We do meaningful work supporting patients with rare and serious diseases, in a collaborative environment where strong operators are recognized and given room to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day project management across multiple concurrent enterprise implementations, from kickoff through go-live and post-live stabilization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confirm progress with internal teams (Customer Engineers, Product, Client Engagement) directly: verify true status, dig in to understand true progress, surface blockers early, and escalate when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead client-facing meetings, send clear and structured updates, and build trusted relationships with platform champions and executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize dependencies, flag deviations early, and drive forward creative solutions when the path forward isn’t obvious. Provide pushback in a way that preserves the relationship and keeps the project on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop hands-on expertise in the Courier Health platform — configuring workflows, profiles, and custom attributes, and partnering with Customer Engineers on data mapping and technical specs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document implementation decisions, configurations, and requirements thoroughly, and contribute to internal playbooks and templates that make the whole team better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience in implementation, technical project management, or client-facing SaaS, ideally in a complex, multi-stakeholder environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of &lt;em&gt;confirming&lt;/em&gt; progress, not just chasing it; you know what done actually looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable presenting to and managing senior client stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication — your updates, recaps, and trackers are clear, structured, and trusted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical aptitude: you&#39;re not an engineer, but you can understand data models, system configurations, and how platforms work under the hood&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating and holding delivery boundaries. You know how to say no in a way that preserves the relationship and centers the success of the project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare, life sciences, or specialty pharma experience is a plus; genuine curiosity about the space is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with project management tools and JIRA; experience with Smartsheet, Notion, or similar platforms is a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% paid employee health benefit options (including medical, dental, and vision)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer funded match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch on Fridays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great Place to Work Certified&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual salary range for the target level for this role is&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;$95,000 - $120,000 + equity + benefits, including medical, dental, and vision. This role is eligible for performance-based variable compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Courier Health is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

peakxv-appier:greenhouse:7582218.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Appier&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Appier is a software-as-a-service (SaaS) company that uses artificial intelligence (AI) to power business decision-making. Founded in 2012 with a vision of democratizing AI, Appier’s mission is turning AI into ROI by making software intelligent. Appier now has 17 offices across APAC, Europe and U.S., and is listed on the Tokyo Stock Exchange (Ticker number: 4180). Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.appier.com/&quot;&gt;www.appier.com&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Software Engineer who will primarily lead the development and evolution of the Appier Web SDK, while also contributing to frontend web UI development for enterprise-facing web applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position combines deep JavaScript engineering with frontend application development. You will work on improving the reliability, performance, and extensibility of Appier Web SDK, while also contributing to frontend architecture for enterprise-facing SaaS applications. Your work will directly impact how Appier’s AI capabilities are delivered and experienced at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with backend engineers, product managers, data teams, and UI/UX designers to deliver robust technical solutions that power Appier’s AI-driven products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[The seniority/title is determined by job-related skills, experience, and evaluation after the interview.]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Is Exciting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work on real-world browser challenges, performance optimization, and SDK architecture — not just UI feature implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have meaningful ownership while collaborating with experienced cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your work will directly power AI-driven experiences embedded in enterprise websites at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the long-term evolution of Appier’s Web SDK architecture, strengthening its scalability, modularity, and maintainability to support future product growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and refine a robust, extensible SDK foundation that can support multiple products, integration scenarios, and enterprise-scale deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve runtime performance, bundle efficiency, browser compatibility, and overall stability in diverse client environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to frontend application architecture for enterprise-facing web products, ensuring performance, consistency, and maintainability across shared components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical debt and architectural risks early, and proactively implement sustainable improvements rather than short-term fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safeguard quality through thoughtful testing strategies and thorough code reviews, helping maintain a strong engineering culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support production stability by investigating and resolving client-side issues when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in product and technical roadmap discussions to ensure the SDK platform evolves in alignment with business and platform strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[Minimum qualifications]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in frontend or JavaScript engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in JavaScript (ES6+) and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of browser internals, DOM, HTTP, web standards, and client-side performance optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or maintaining JavaScript SDKs, libraries, or shared frontend modules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of front-end frameworks and technologies (e.g., React.js, Vue.js) and their ecosystems&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of version control (Git) and CI/CD workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing unit, integration, and end-to-end tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and ownership mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, proactive, and able to collaborate effectively in cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-assisted development tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Windsurf) to accelerate coding, debugging, and refactoring. Familiarity with these tools is expected as part of our team’s daily development workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for clean code, scalability, and performance, curious about new technologies and enthusiastic about developer experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[Preferred qualifications]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern build tools and bundlers (e.g., Babel, Webpack, Vite, Rspack, esbuild, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Node.js, Python, GraphQL, and integrating with various backend services and databases (e.g., MySQL, MongoDB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with testing frameworks such as Jest, Vitest, Playwright, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cross-browser compatibility and performance tuning in complex browser environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with web security practices (CSP, XSS mitigation, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with micro-frontend architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-CS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

peakxv-sigmoid:greenhouse:8349736002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;Location: LATAM (Remote/Bogotá, Colombia)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sigmoid Analytics is looking for a Management Consultant Analyst (MCA) to join our team in LATAM. This role is ideal for individuals eager to learn and grow in business consulting focusing on Data Analytics Strategy. You will support senior consultants in delivering strategic business insights and help companies make informed decisions that drive growth and operational excellence across the region. You will work closely with cross-functional teams and senior leaders, translating business challenges into data-driven strategies that drive growth and performance improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The MCA role, in conjunction with Senior Consultants, serves as the primary contact point with stakeholders and other key requirements sources during the business requirements definition process and throughout the development process. The MCA will also work with Data Analytics and Product teams responsible for translating the business requirements into specific data, functional, and architecture specifications for implementation. Additionally, the MCA will partner closely in defining and driving User Acceptance Testing procedures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Assist senior consultants in executing business consulting projects that provide actionable insights and strategic recommendations.&lt;br&gt;- Support the creation of reports and presentations that guide key business decisions for clients.&lt;br&gt;- Collaborate with teams to address business challenges and develop tailored strategies for growth and efficiency.&lt;br&gt;- Help translate data and insights into practical business solutions that align with client objectives.&lt;br&gt;- Communicate findings clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders in Spanish and English.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bachelor’s degree in Business, Economics, or related field (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;br&gt;- Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with a focus on business strategy.&lt;br&gt;- Familiarity with business analysis tools (Excel, Power BI, etc.) and an understanding of how to apply insights to real-world business challenges.&lt;br&gt;- Strong verbal, written and presentation skills in both Spanish and English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Interest in working with clients across LATAM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 2+ years of experience in a business-related role is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Passion for technology, process innovation, tools, change management and work with and for people&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Willingness to make the difference from strategic transformation plans to implementation and measurement, and most important: &lt;strong&gt;Make things happen!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Strong critical thinking and digital capabilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Basic understanding of business strategy, consulting, and decision-making processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 1+ years of experience in a management consulting firm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Communication skills (written and spoken) in Portuguese.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Experience working with a CPG or FMCG leading company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to being contacted by our Talent Acquisition team via phone call, email, SMS, WhatsApp, or other communication channels regarding your application and relevant career opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

qedinvestors-nubank:greenhouse:7585309.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nubank is one of the largest digital financial platforms in the world, with more than 122 million customers across Brazil, Mexico, and Colombia. Guided by our mission to fight complexity and empower people, we are redefining financial services in Latin America and this is still just the beginning of the purple future we&#39;re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: NU), we combine proprietary technology, data intelligence, and an efficient operating model to deliver financial products that are simple, accessible, and human.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our impact has been recognized by global rankings such as Time 100 Companies, Fast Company’s Most Innovative Companies, and Forbes World’s Best Bank. Visit our institutional page&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://international.nubank.com.br/careers/&quot;&gt;https://international.nubank.com.br/careers/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior System Engineer - Systems Performance Team The Systems Performance team is part of the Computing Squad (Foundation / Runtime Platforms). You will be part of a team focused on building deep diagnostic tools and performing high-level analysis to reduce latency, infrastructure costs, and increase services efficiency. You will execute performance investigations and identify systemic bottlenecks across one of the largest JVM-based microservice architectures in the world, interacting with everything from the Linux Kernel to cloud-wide orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be responsible for&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Investigation: Identify systemic bottlenecks and efficiency opportunities across a massive microservice architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative Solutions: Develop and deliver technical solutions that address complex challenges with a focus on medium and long-term impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Optimization: Deep dive into the technical aspects, capabilities, and limitations of our systems to drive continuous improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Root Cause Analysis: Perform high-level analysis to identify and resolve the root causes of performance issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive Design: Anticipate technical and product issues, making design decisions to prevent future bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Collaboration: Share knowledge and mentor others, ensuring a high standard of quality and teamwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for a person who has&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Expertise: Experience and knowledge of cloud platforms (AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Environment: Background working with critical, high-availability services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JVM &amp;amp; Internals: Deep interest in understanding service internals, JVM architecture, and performance characteristics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OS Fundamentals: Knowledge of operating systems (scheduling, memory management, I/O) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical Thinking: Passion for performance tuning, capacity planning, and finding creative ways to improve system efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultural Alignment: Enthusiasm for ownership, simplicity, and a &quot;veracity-first&quot; approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Total compensation includes base salary, RSUs and benefits. Base salary range: $13,000 - $15,600&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity of earning equity at Nu&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental and Vision Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Insurance and AD&amp;amp;D&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended maternity and paternity leaves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nucleo - Our learning platform of courses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NuLanguage - Our language learning program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NuCare - Our mental health and wellness assistance program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended maternity and paternity leaves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401K&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Saving Plans - Health Saving Account and Flexible Spending Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-from-home Allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation Assistance Package, if applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Model for this Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nubank operates in a hybrid model, where teams collaborate remotely and periodically come together for about one week of in-person sessions. For Canadian team members, these sessions typically take place in one of our hubs (Brazil, Mexico, Colombia, or the United States) and are communicated well in advance to allow proper planning, with travel support provided to ensure equitable access to these global collaboration opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparency in the use of AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our recruitment process may involve the use of artificial intelligence–enabled tools, such as automated interview transcription and analysis, to support the evaluation process. Artificial intelligence is not used to make final hiring decisions; all decisions are made by human reviewers.&lt;/p&gt;

